WEBVTT


00:01:37.505 --> 00:01:43.065
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
‎QUEEN CHU‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

00:01:52.185 --> 00:01:55.985
Yanlai, you had a formidable presence
at today's court.

00:01:59.105 --> 00:02:02.105
I personally decided to kill
the Northern Desert King.

00:02:03.145 --> 00:02:05.225
But clearly, you won't regret it.

00:02:05.305 --> 00:02:06.505
Since childhood,

00:02:07.025 --> 00:02:09.265
have I ever said "regret"?

00:02:09.345 --> 00:02:11.105
You've made up your mind.

00:02:12.305 --> 00:02:13.225
I won't stop you.

00:02:14.905 --> 00:02:16.025
You can't stop me.

00:02:16.665 --> 00:02:18.065
Before you go,

00:02:19.225 --> 00:02:20.785
let's do something first.

00:02:22.585 --> 00:02:26.025
Your mother's tablet
can be placed in our ancestral hall.

00:02:30.585 --> 00:02:31.625
What did you say?

00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:34.625
Yanlai,

00:02:36.425 --> 00:02:39.345
don't you always want her tablet
to be placed there?

00:02:39.945 --> 00:02:41.265
Now is the perfect time.

00:02:42.345 --> 00:02:45.625
You'll enter the pedigree too.
You and your mother

00:02:46.425 --> 00:02:48.865
will become rightful members
of the Xie family.

00:02:59.185 --> 00:03:00.105
No need.

00:03:05.545 --> 00:03:08.025
Rightful identity…

00:03:09.865 --> 00:03:11.385
Recognition of the clan…

00:03:11.465 --> 00:03:13.265
Don't you want any?

00:03:13.345 --> 00:03:15.145
I used to think

00:03:15.225 --> 00:03:17.865
it was all I sought, but now…

00:03:18.985 --> 00:03:20.105
Now what?

00:03:21.145 --> 00:03:23.625
My mother doesn't need
offerings of the Xie Family,

00:03:24.265 --> 00:03:27.545
and I don't need the recognition
from the Xie's pedigree.

00:03:28.465 --> 00:03:30.465
Nor do I need a rightful identity.

00:03:31.665 --> 00:03:33.265
I know who I am,

00:03:34.105 --> 00:03:35.825
and I know what I want.

00:03:36.905 --> 00:03:37.825
That's enough.

00:03:38.905 --> 00:03:40.905
After going through all this,

00:03:41.745 --> 00:03:43.945
you've really changed.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.425
Since you've made up your mind,

00:03:49.945 --> 00:03:50.825
so be it.

00:03:53.185 --> 00:03:54.145
Xie Yanfang.

00:03:57.145 --> 00:03:58.385
Five years ago,

00:03:59.425 --> 00:04:01.425
you gave me the Bloodburn Pill.

00:04:02.945 --> 00:04:04.345
Did you know

00:04:04.945 --> 00:04:06.225
anyone who took it

00:04:08.585 --> 00:04:09.665
would die?

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:21.425
This secret elixir
only belongs to our direct line.

00:04:22.505 --> 00:04:24.025
It can even revive the dying.

00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:27.825
Keep it with you in case of emergency.

00:04:54.425 --> 00:04:55.305
Yanlai.

00:05:02.945 --> 00:05:04.345
How did you know I'm here?

00:05:05.105 --> 00:05:06.225
You're my brother.

00:05:06.985 --> 00:05:08.545
Of course, I keep track of where you go.

00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:10.665
I came here

00:05:11.265 --> 00:05:12.905
to take you back home.

00:05:15.825 --> 00:05:16.745
No need.

00:05:17.345 --> 00:05:20.745
Here in Yunzhong,
people go through wind and sand.

00:05:21.825 --> 00:05:23.905
Living by one's ability isn't too bad.

00:05:24.505 --> 00:05:26.105
Young Master cares for you.

00:05:26.185 --> 00:05:27.385
How could you be ungrateful?

00:05:27.465 --> 00:05:29.705
You really think Chu Ling trusts you?

00:05:29.785 --> 00:05:32.265
If he knows you're a Xie,
can you still stay?

00:05:32.345 --> 00:05:33.425
He wouldn't care.

00:05:34.705 --> 00:05:37.865
All he cares about
is whether I can slay enemies

00:05:38.585 --> 00:05:40.185
and guard this place.

00:05:40.785 --> 00:05:43.265
He doesn't care who I really am.

00:05:43.985 --> 00:05:45.865
Chu Ling has 200,000 frontier troops.

00:05:46.465 --> 00:05:47.585
If he wants to kill you,

00:05:48.225 --> 00:05:50.105
you won't be able to resist.

00:05:50.905 --> 00:05:51.945
Will you gamble?

00:05:53.345 --> 00:05:54.745
I have nothing to lose.

00:05:55.865 --> 00:05:57.065
I don't care.

00:05:57.945 --> 00:05:59.625
So, this is your choice.

00:06:18.145 --> 00:06:19.585
If I say I didn't know,

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:22.345
will you believe me?

00:06:53.865 --> 00:06:56.225
Xie Yanlai didn't tell
his brother in advance.

00:06:56.305 --> 00:06:57.905
Xie Yanfang must be angry.

00:06:58.425 --> 00:06:59.425
Wrong.

00:07:00.025 --> 00:07:03.545
Xie Yanfang doesn't care
whether he was informed in advance.

00:07:04.225 --> 00:07:06.225
He has raised too many lackeys.

00:07:06.305 --> 00:07:07.785
It's normal that one of them

00:07:08.465 --> 00:07:09.625
may betray him.

00:07:10.745 --> 00:07:11.905
What matters to him?

00:07:14.665 --> 00:07:18.265
Xie Yanlai has won successive exploits
and enjoys supreme prestige.

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:20.025
If it goes on like this,

00:07:20.945 --> 00:07:24.745
his reputation will overshadow
Xie Yanfang's.

00:07:25.345 --> 00:07:29.145
That's exactly what Xie Yanfang
won't allow to happen.

00:07:29.945 --> 00:07:30.785
It seems

00:07:31.785 --> 00:07:33.305
big changes are coming to his family.

00:07:33.385 --> 00:07:35.945
Don't underestimate Xie Yanfang.

00:07:36.745 --> 00:07:38.505
With his mastery of strategies,

00:07:38.585 --> 00:07:41.025
how would he not have a backup plan?

00:07:41.705 --> 00:07:44.145
There must still be room for a reversal.

00:07:44.945 --> 00:07:46.825
Let's not worry about them.

00:07:47.745 --> 00:07:49.825
Is everything ready for tonight's banquet?

00:07:50.585 --> 00:07:53.345
Rest assured. Everything is ready.

00:07:58.105 --> 00:08:03.025
TOMB OF THE LATE LADY XIE

00:08:13.105 --> 00:08:16.025
HER NAME WAS CUIYU.
A LIFE MARKED BY MISFORTUNE

00:08:23.865 --> 00:08:25.585
We agreed on a hundred liang of gold.

00:08:25.665 --> 00:08:26.905
Why is it 50 now?

00:08:26.985 --> 00:08:29.265
If the boy weren't a Xie,

00:08:29.345 --> 00:08:31.185
I wouldn't have risked my life for him.

00:08:31.265 --> 00:08:35.705
You got 50 liang of gold
for one single night.

00:08:35.784 --> 00:08:38.385
In my opinion, it's a good deal for you.

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:41.745
That boy is the Xie's bloodline,

00:08:42.345 --> 00:08:45.105
but after all, he's an illegitimate child.

00:08:45.185 --> 00:08:47.345
Don't think he's very valuable.

00:08:48.225 --> 00:08:50.665
Send him back home as soon as you can.

00:08:50.745 --> 00:08:52.985
Don't delay my business tonight.

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:54.345
Mother.

00:08:57.705 --> 00:09:02.025
Son, you've grown up.
You should be sensible.

00:09:02.105 --> 00:09:04.545
The Xie Family is where you belong.

00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:07.625
From now on, you'll enjoy a great life,
and that's enough.

00:09:08.985 --> 00:09:10.745
Come on, you…

00:09:15.105 --> 00:09:17.145
Listen. Mother isn't leaving.

00:09:17.225 --> 00:09:18.585
Let go, will you?

00:09:18.665 --> 00:09:21.385
I'll go buy some fabrics
to make you new clothes.

00:09:21.465 --> 00:09:23.825
I really won't leave.
Look. It's getting late.

00:09:23.905 --> 00:09:25.705
The cloth shop will be closed.

00:09:26.425 --> 00:09:27.585
Good boy.

00:09:27.665 --> 00:09:28.785
Come on.

00:09:32.185 --> 00:09:34.705
-Is he the ninth young master?
-That's right.

00:09:34.785 --> 00:09:37.385
Look. You're the young master now.
How can you wear ragged clothes?

00:09:37.465 --> 00:09:40.345
I'll go make you some new clothes.
Wait here.

00:09:44.745 --> 00:09:45.585
What is his name?

00:09:46.385 --> 00:09:48.585
Whatever. Call him anything you want.

00:10:01.385 --> 00:10:03.505
Mother, it's been long.

00:10:05.265 --> 00:10:06.385
When I was little,

00:10:08.545 --> 00:10:10.185
I thought you left for new clothes.

00:10:12.025 --> 00:10:14.345
So, I waited for you on the stairs
of Xie Residence.

00:10:15.425 --> 00:10:16.745
I waited until night.

00:10:19.025 --> 00:10:20.865
Until my candied hawthorn melted.

00:10:24.585 --> 00:10:25.745
But I still failed

00:10:28.105 --> 00:10:29.585
to see you back.

00:10:31.865 --> 00:10:32.865
Later,

00:10:33.385 --> 00:10:35.305
they said you were a dirty woman,

00:10:38.825 --> 00:10:40.185
and I was a courtesan's son.

00:10:41.425 --> 00:10:42.785
I studied really hard

00:10:43.705 --> 00:10:45.025
and learned martial arts.

00:10:46.225 --> 00:10:47.705
No matter how hard it was,

00:10:48.785 --> 00:10:50.145
it never felt bitter.

00:10:51.185 --> 00:10:52.425
I just wished

00:10:53.905 --> 00:10:55.465
that one day

00:10:56.905 --> 00:10:59.625
I could be a rightful member
of the Xie Family.

00:11:03.425 --> 00:11:05.465
I wanted them to think highly of me.

00:11:07.105 --> 00:11:08.665
I also hoped

00:11:11.665 --> 00:11:15.545
that your tablet could be placed
in their ancestral hall.

00:11:16.985 --> 00:11:21.265
To make this happen,
I endured insults and risked my life.

00:11:22.185 --> 00:11:24.145
Even if I felt like a ghost there,

00:11:27.945 --> 00:11:31.945
I felt happier than being
a wandering man as Fu Jiu.

00:11:32.025 --> 00:11:34.945
I used to think if I became successful,

00:11:35.025 --> 00:11:36.705
they wouldn't scorn us anymore.

00:11:36.785 --> 00:11:39.065
It turns out you abandoned me long ago.

00:11:39.145 --> 00:11:40.385
Right?

00:11:42.505 --> 00:11:43.865
I've never hated you.

00:11:45.505 --> 00:11:46.825
Even now,

00:11:48.585 --> 00:11:50.345
I still don't hate you.

00:11:52.505 --> 00:11:54.145
You suffered pains when bearing me.

00:11:55.225 --> 00:11:56.825
You pulled through when raising me.

00:11:58.265 --> 00:11:59.385
Maybe

00:12:01.425 --> 00:12:03.425
on the day you left me,

00:12:07.265 --> 00:12:09.025
you cried hard too.

00:12:11.465 --> 00:12:12.665
Right?

00:12:12.745 --> 00:12:14.025
I've figured out one thing.

00:12:14.705 --> 00:12:17.465
We can't get everything,
even if we fight for it.

00:12:17.545 --> 00:12:20.825
Mother, I met someone.

00:12:25.025 --> 00:12:27.025
The most important person in my life.

00:12:30.665 --> 00:12:32.105
Her name is Zhao.

00:12:33.665 --> 00:12:35.305
She made me understand

00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:39.465
a rightful identity doesn't matter.

00:12:41.145 --> 00:12:42.345
I am who I am.

00:12:44.825 --> 00:12:46.345
And I am your son.

00:12:51.905 --> 00:12:52.745
Jiu.

00:12:56.625 --> 00:12:57.905
Don't be sad.

00:13:09.945 --> 00:13:11.385
It's strange.

00:13:11.985 --> 00:13:15.545
Before, as Xie Yanlai, you would disdain

00:13:16.425 --> 00:13:18.425
and reject such useless comfort.

00:13:20.505 --> 00:13:22.145
But now, as Fu Jiu,

00:13:23.225 --> 00:13:25.225
you must want to hear this,

00:13:32.185 --> 00:13:33.185
"Don't be sad."

00:13:48.305 --> 00:13:49.465
I didn't expect this

00:13:53.625 --> 00:13:54.985
because I dared not.

00:13:58.065 --> 00:13:59.025
Nor could I get any.

00:14:01.825 --> 00:14:03.265
The rightful identity

00:14:06.425 --> 00:14:07.705
and the family love

00:14:10.185 --> 00:14:11.425
were out of my reach.

00:14:16.945 --> 00:14:19.025
So, I had to pretend I didn't want any.

00:14:22.305 --> 00:14:23.945
Only in this way could I relieve

00:14:24.825 --> 00:14:25.905
the pain and shame

00:14:28.345 --> 00:14:29.545
in my heart.

00:14:32.305 --> 00:14:33.145
But now,

00:14:34.865 --> 00:14:36.065
no need for that.

00:14:47.025 --> 00:14:49.465
Yeah. No need for that.

00:14:49.985 --> 00:14:51.785
Now I know who I am.

00:14:54.105 --> 00:14:55.465
Whether Xie Yanlai

00:14:55.985 --> 00:14:59.105
or Fu Jiu, I'm just myself.

00:15:00.745 --> 00:15:02.145
You're mine.

00:15:03.145 --> 00:15:04.825
In life,

00:15:05.825 --> 00:15:07.545
having the freedom to choose

00:15:08.505 --> 00:15:10.105
is already the greatest happiness.

00:15:12.385 --> 00:15:13.985
You're good as you are.

00:15:15.385 --> 00:15:18.545
But now, you're always hindered.

00:15:19.545 --> 00:15:22.665
If I kill the King,
the problem will be solved.

00:15:23.705 --> 00:15:25.185
That's my problem.

00:15:28.425 --> 00:15:31.745
Why didn't you tell me
before you made that decision?

00:15:32.345 --> 00:15:33.585
No need.

00:15:35.425 --> 00:15:36.665
You wouldn't let me go.

00:15:37.265 --> 00:15:39.785
My father and the King
fought for over a decade.

00:15:39.865 --> 00:15:41.265
Do you know how hard--?

00:15:41.825 --> 00:15:43.585
Zhao, I know.

00:15:44.185 --> 00:15:45.145
You worry about me.

00:15:46.465 --> 00:15:49.305
But this time,
let me do something for you.

00:16:11.985 --> 00:16:13.105
According to Father,

00:16:13.985 --> 00:16:17.705
the armor is a soldier's second life.

00:16:20.425 --> 00:16:22.305
You never wore it before

00:16:22.945 --> 00:16:26.185
because you thought your life
wasn't worth it.

00:16:28.425 --> 00:16:29.945
Now,

00:16:31.665 --> 00:16:32.865
I want you to put it on.

00:16:34.625 --> 00:16:35.505
I want you to know

00:16:36.665 --> 00:16:38.465
I'm waiting for you to return alive.

00:16:40.185 --> 00:16:41.905
Just like how my father

00:16:42.865 --> 00:16:44.705
took you out of the desert alive.

00:16:55.705 --> 00:16:56.545
All right.

00:16:59.505 --> 00:17:00.665
You make a vow.

00:17:04.545 --> 00:17:05.385
Make it to my father.

00:17:27.105 --> 00:17:28.385
I give you my word.

00:17:30.065 --> 00:17:31.825
I will come back alive.

00:17:40.065 --> 00:17:40.985
You must not lie to me.

00:17:46.345 --> 00:17:48.385
I swear to General Chu's armor.

00:17:51.305 --> 00:17:52.665
I will stay alive

00:17:54.105 --> 00:17:55.705
and return the armor to him.

00:18:26.345 --> 00:18:28.905
Xie Yanlai has become
even more uncontrollable.

00:18:28.985 --> 00:18:31.385
At today's court, he made a military vow

00:18:31.465 --> 00:18:33.025
to kill the Northern Desert King.

00:18:33.105 --> 00:18:35.025
Ministers were stunned.

00:18:37.305 --> 00:18:39.145
He's never a caged bird.

00:18:40.665 --> 00:18:41.705
Now that he's strong enough,

00:18:43.665 --> 00:18:45.425
he will surely leave.

00:18:47.745 --> 00:18:50.865
That man… He's back, huh?

00:18:50.945 --> 00:18:52.705
Yes, in the city.

00:18:52.785 --> 00:18:54.985
I heard he had great prestige

00:18:55.585 --> 00:18:56.665
among frontier troops.

00:18:57.425 --> 00:18:58.825
Glad to hear that.

00:19:00.545 --> 00:19:03.105
I think it's time to have the next general

00:19:04.145 --> 00:19:05.065
take the stage.

00:19:11.145 --> 00:19:16.465
GRACE OF THE LIANG GENERATIONS

00:19:21.865 --> 00:19:23.065
Mr. Liang is back.

00:19:24.185 --> 00:19:26.025
He's back.

00:19:26.105 --> 00:19:26.945
Come on.

00:19:28.025 --> 00:19:30.265
-He's back!
-Mr. Liang, you're finally back.

00:19:30.345 --> 00:19:33.265
-Not Mr. Liang. Now, he's General Liang.
-Mr. Liang!

00:19:33.345 --> 00:19:36.025
The Roving General titled by His Majesty.

00:19:37.905 --> 00:19:41.465
-And you are?
-General Liang, I'm Huang.

00:19:41.545 --> 00:19:44.305
General, why didn't you tell us before?

00:19:44.385 --> 00:19:46.145
We could have welcomed you from afar.

00:19:46.225 --> 00:19:47.985
-Yeah.
-That's right.

00:19:48.065 --> 00:19:50.385
You're the hero of our clan.

00:19:50.465 --> 00:19:51.905
Don't stand here. Let's get in.

00:19:51.985 --> 00:19:53.425
Yeah. Come in, please.

00:19:53.505 --> 00:19:54.865
-Get in.
-Come on.

00:19:54.945 --> 00:19:56.825
-This way.
-Hurry.

00:20:01.225 --> 00:20:04.585
NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY
SEVERE PUNISHMENT FOR VIOLATORS

00:20:07.505 --> 00:20:10.185
Father. Mother.

00:20:12.385 --> 00:20:14.585
I've only been a general for half a day,

00:20:16.185 --> 00:20:19.025
but visitors have already flooded in.

00:20:20.225 --> 00:20:21.785
Many relatives and friends

00:20:22.625 --> 00:20:24.705
were popping up.

00:20:28.825 --> 00:20:30.745
They greeted me warmly

00:20:32.305 --> 00:20:33.745
and shed tears

00:20:35.465 --> 00:20:37.065
for seeing me again.

00:20:37.585 --> 00:20:38.465
TABLET OF MR. LIANG

00:20:38.545 --> 00:20:41.065
Actually, I barely remember them.

00:20:43.145 --> 00:20:44.265
It doesn't matter.

00:20:44.865 --> 00:20:46.305
TABLET OF MRS. LIANG

00:20:50.345 --> 00:20:53.265
ANCESTRAL HALL OF THE LIANG FAMILY

00:20:57.745 --> 00:21:01.425
Soon, everyone in the Capital will know

00:21:02.025 --> 00:21:03.185
I can bring glory

00:21:04.105 --> 00:21:06.425
to the Liang Family.

00:21:49.785 --> 00:21:52.065
The honey filling is overflowing.

00:21:52.145 --> 00:21:53.345
Way too sweet.

00:21:53.425 --> 00:21:55.185
Is it for Commander Xie?

00:21:55.265 --> 00:21:57.465
Oh no. It's for General Fu Jiu, right?

00:21:59.025 --> 00:22:00.865
His journey is really concerning.

00:22:02.185 --> 00:22:04.505
-Shall I divine for him?
-No need.

00:22:05.785 --> 00:22:07.425
He never believes in fate.

00:22:11.425 --> 00:22:12.465
Letter from the Stronghold.

00:22:12.545 --> 00:22:14.545
They found the old file
of Xiaonan caravan.

00:22:27.385 --> 00:22:30.225
As expected, three months before the fire,

00:22:30.305 --> 00:22:31.985
they passed the village six times.

00:22:33.385 --> 00:22:35.545
Why did you suddenly investigate
such an old case?

00:22:36.225 --> 00:22:39.665
Jiu figured out
the fire resulted from fire oil.

00:22:40.265 --> 00:22:43.465
It might be transported
for the Northern Desert.

00:22:45.465 --> 00:22:46.665
Judging from the file,

00:22:47.345 --> 00:22:50.065
this caravan passed six times.

00:22:50.145 --> 00:22:52.425
But every time,
they carried very few goods.

00:22:52.505 --> 00:22:56.385
That wasn't something
a normal caravan would do.

00:22:57.185 --> 00:22:58.305
It had to be something else.

00:22:59.225 --> 00:23:00.865
What could it be?

00:23:00.945 --> 00:23:03.145
Wei Village only had dozens of villagers

00:23:03.225 --> 00:23:04.625
and uninhabited wilderness.

00:23:05.305 --> 00:23:06.825
What could they be up to?

00:23:08.585 --> 00:23:10.185
So, Jiu was right.

00:23:11.705 --> 00:23:13.145
Northern Desert foes
conspired with Xiaonan

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:14.585
to burn the Wei Village

00:23:15.385 --> 00:23:17.265
with an aim at Cangmu Stronghold.

00:23:19.345 --> 00:23:21.545
To be exact, my mother.

00:23:24.065 --> 00:23:26.345
To reveal my mother was an enemy general

00:23:27.385 --> 00:23:29.545
would be the best weapon
against my father.

00:23:30.345 --> 00:23:34.425
In that case, frontier troops
would have a new master.

00:23:36.505 --> 00:23:42.065
That would benefit Xiaonan
and the Northern Desert.

00:23:43.745 --> 00:23:46.305
Xiao Xun and his father
even struck a deal with evil enemies.

00:23:46.905 --> 00:23:48.625
Then we'll let them know

00:23:50.025 --> 00:23:52.825
how it feels to be devoured
by their own ambition.

00:24:17.865 --> 00:24:19.265
Why are we meeting here?

00:24:21.145 --> 00:24:22.505
Because your girl

00:24:23.465 --> 00:24:25.345
has a lot to say to you.

00:24:26.305 --> 00:24:28.025
But a princess can't say that.

00:24:31.425 --> 00:24:32.265
More maltose was used.

00:24:34.025 --> 00:24:35.305
It's sweeter.

00:24:36.105 --> 00:24:36.945
You made it?

00:24:42.465 --> 00:24:43.705
It feels sweet enough just looking at it.

00:24:45.505 --> 00:24:48.225
Jiu, you've picked up sweet talk.

00:24:51.305 --> 00:24:52.585
I can do more

00:24:53.665 --> 00:24:55.065
than you think I can.

00:24:58.345 --> 00:25:01.465
You must eat it. I made it overnight.

00:25:05.865 --> 00:25:09.585
I've never seen you in armor before.
What a young general.

00:25:10.545 --> 00:25:11.705
You look so gallant.

00:25:12.745 --> 00:25:14.225
No wonder the ladies in Yunzhong

00:25:15.465 --> 00:25:17.185
compliment your looks.

00:25:25.665 --> 00:25:27.265
Their compliments

00:25:28.665 --> 00:25:30.145
aren't as sweet as yours.

00:25:31.945 --> 00:25:33.065
And they aren't

00:25:35.745 --> 00:25:37.025
as pretty as you.

00:25:47.945 --> 00:25:48.905
Don't forget

00:25:49.985 --> 00:25:51.545
what you promised me.

00:26:00.025 --> 00:26:01.025
I won't.

00:26:05.025 --> 00:26:08.025
When I'm back, I'll return it.

00:26:10.105 --> 00:26:10.945
Return?

00:26:12.585 --> 00:26:13.745
Both.

00:26:15.545 --> 00:26:16.545
The armor and me.

00:26:17.385 --> 00:26:20.225
If you doubt it… Words are no proof.

00:26:23.625 --> 00:26:24.825
Let this be my pledge.

00:27:46.985 --> 00:27:50.425
Zhao, you were meant

00:27:51.665 --> 00:27:54.385
to soar up there. And my role

00:27:55.505 --> 00:27:57.105
is to uphold you.

00:27:58.185 --> 00:28:02.625
CAPITAL

00:28:16.505 --> 00:28:19.145
Tang, why did you come to me?

00:28:19.225 --> 00:28:22.985
Are you going to see your parents?

00:28:27.065 --> 00:28:27.905
Zhao,

00:28:28.745 --> 00:28:30.665
I used to think

00:28:30.745 --> 00:28:34.105
manipulating the court like you
would be truly great.

00:28:34.985 --> 00:28:37.265
And after going through various schemes,

00:28:37.345 --> 00:28:41.145
I realized to be a hero
was the real thrill.

00:28:41.865 --> 00:28:45.745
However, it might not be right for me.

00:28:50.825 --> 00:28:53.905
Since I was little, I've dreamed
of having a good husband

00:28:54.505 --> 00:28:55.825
and living a life

00:28:55.905 --> 00:28:58.265
inside my house as a good wife and mother.

00:28:59.825 --> 00:29:02.025
But now, I've changed my mind.

00:29:02.745 --> 00:29:03.705
It's because of you.

00:29:04.905 --> 00:29:05.865
You've taught me.

00:29:05.945 --> 00:29:10.625
Even if we're women,
we can still do a lot.

00:29:13.145 --> 00:29:15.985
Even though I can't become an official,

00:29:16.785 --> 00:29:19.905
the world is big enough,
and I can go out to experience it.

00:29:27.985 --> 00:29:28.825
Here.

00:29:33.065 --> 00:29:36.585
Recent literary gatherings
make me understand.

00:29:37.185 --> 00:29:41.185
Giving chances to ladies like me
for them to shine

00:29:42.425 --> 00:29:45.025
makes me even happier than my own glory.

00:29:46.385 --> 00:29:50.625
So, I intend to introduce
literary gatherings elsewhere

00:29:50.705 --> 00:29:52.585
to enlighten more ladies.

00:29:53.185 --> 00:29:56.825
They don't need to live
within others' expectations.

00:29:57.745 --> 00:30:01.585
They deserve the world of their own.

00:30:07.225 --> 00:30:08.145
Then this world

00:30:09.705 --> 00:30:11.145
will shine because of you.

00:30:21.185 --> 00:30:23.785
Did you just let Xie Yanlai go?

00:30:25.665 --> 00:30:27.065
Don't be silly.

00:30:28.425 --> 00:30:32.065
A lot of people in the court
want Xie Yanlai dead.

00:30:32.665 --> 00:30:34.505
I don't have to do anything.

00:30:35.945 --> 00:30:36.785
‎Really?

00:30:37.705 --> 00:30:40.185
-For example?
-Don't you remember?

00:30:41.985 --> 00:30:44.745
The famous gentleman of the Xie Family.

00:30:44.825 --> 00:30:47.585
Do you mean Xie Yanfang?

00:30:48.185 --> 00:30:50.745
It can't be that easy to kill
the Northern Desert King.

00:30:50.825 --> 00:30:53.385
Chu Ling couldn't do that
within 20 years on the frontier.

00:30:53.945 --> 00:30:55.305
How can Xie Yanlai do it?

00:30:55.385 --> 00:30:58.945
What if Xie Yanlai really succeeds?

00:31:00.785 --> 00:31:02.785
Then he can't live.

00:31:04.825 --> 00:31:07.105
A lackey who only takes orders

00:31:07.705 --> 00:31:10.025
betrayed his master twice in a row.

00:31:10.905 --> 00:31:12.745
Xie Yanfang won't let him live.

00:31:13.865 --> 00:31:15.465
In the Xie Family,

00:31:16.345 --> 00:31:18.385
Xie Yanlai has been abandoned.

00:31:48.945 --> 00:31:49.985
Why again?

00:31:51.145 --> 00:31:52.265
I wanted to divine for General.

00:31:52.865 --> 00:31:56.785
But Her Highness told me
he didn't believe in this.

00:31:56.865 --> 00:31:58.985
-Then don't do that.
-But…

00:32:01.065 --> 00:32:04.265
What lies ahead is dangerous.
And Her Highness made a vow.

00:32:04.865 --> 00:32:08.705
When she's the Grand Princess,
she won't marry or have children.

00:32:08.785 --> 00:32:12.105
Then, her power won't fall to anyone
or benefit anyone.

00:32:12.185 --> 00:32:13.585
If she breaks her vow…

00:32:14.745 --> 00:32:17.665
What if Her Highness falls for him
and her vow comes true?

00:32:17.745 --> 00:32:19.585
Then don't divine.

00:32:20.825 --> 00:32:22.705
Who says a princess can't love?

00:32:23.505 --> 00:32:24.585
It makes sense.

00:32:25.425 --> 00:32:28.785
As the saying goes,
love is bound by destiny.

00:32:28.865 --> 00:32:31.505
In love, no one can be forced.

00:32:31.585 --> 00:32:33.225
Nor can anyone

00:32:34.025 --> 00:32:35.425
run away from it.

00:32:37.865 --> 00:32:40.985
But the state matters. So do the people.

00:32:41.945 --> 00:32:45.505
They weigh more than romance.

00:32:45.585 --> 00:32:49.385
But if you have to cage your heart, what…

00:32:49.465 --> 00:32:51.425
What's the difference from being a puppet?

00:32:57.025 --> 00:32:58.185
Difference?

00:32:59.025 --> 00:33:01.745
The difference is, a puppet has no choice.

00:33:02.345 --> 00:33:05.905
But I have the power to choose.

00:33:07.585 --> 00:33:11.265
He went to war for me.
Then I'll guard the court.

00:33:12.945 --> 00:33:15.425
I will protect the state.

00:33:16.425 --> 00:33:18.465
And I'll make it impregnable.

00:33:19.465 --> 00:33:21.585
Then the one I love can be safe.

00:33:23.345 --> 00:33:26.905
This is my choice.

00:33:32.825 --> 00:33:35.865
After the siege, Wangcheng

00:33:35.945 --> 00:33:38.185
was in ruins, awaiting revival.

00:33:38.265 --> 00:33:40.265
The court took it seriously

00:33:40.345 --> 00:33:43.225
and opened up Wangcheng trade route.

00:33:43.305 --> 00:33:44.905
In that case, we need

00:33:45.585 --> 00:33:48.585
a supervisor of the Maritime Trade Office
for commercial affairs.

00:33:49.185 --> 00:33:52.545
This supervisor must excel
in frontier trade.

00:33:52.625 --> 00:33:54.025
Mr. Xie, since we have candidates,

00:33:54.865 --> 00:33:56.385
why don't we recommend them

00:33:57.305 --> 00:33:59.145
for His Majesty to choose from?

00:33:59.945 --> 00:34:02.625
I recommend Zhao Su,
pupil of the Xie Family.

00:34:02.705 --> 00:34:05.145
He knows trade routes very well.

00:34:05.225 --> 00:34:07.465
I recommend Zhou Ming, pupil of Mr. Deng.

00:34:07.545 --> 00:34:09.344
He was in charge of water transport.

00:34:09.945 --> 00:34:11.545
This is a serious matter.

00:34:11.625 --> 00:34:14.465
We request Your Majesty
and Your Highness to make the decision.

00:34:15.425 --> 00:34:18.105
Mr. Deng and Mr. Xie
are important ministers.

00:34:18.185 --> 00:34:19.985
Their pupils have unique talents.

00:34:20.505 --> 00:34:21.985
How about they take charge together?

00:34:23.185 --> 00:34:26.425
Zhou Ming, Mr. Deng's pupil,
excels in finance.

00:34:26.505 --> 00:34:29.985
Zhao Su, Mr. Xie's pupil,
knows frontier trade.

00:34:30.585 --> 00:34:32.945
Balancing each other,
they're a perfect match.

00:34:33.905 --> 00:34:34.945
I approve.

00:34:35.025 --> 00:34:36.744
Hereby, Zhou Ming and Zhao Su

00:34:36.824 --> 00:34:39.185
take charge of frontier trade taxes

00:34:39.264 --> 00:34:41.065
and customs clearance.

00:34:42.385 --> 00:34:44.344
Let me add one more thing.

00:34:45.065 --> 00:34:47.905
Wangcheng trade route
concerns frontier defense.

00:34:48.585 --> 00:34:51.264
I propose that special goods

00:34:51.344 --> 00:34:54.105
can't be transported without my approval.

00:34:54.744 --> 00:34:57.745
What are the special goods
Your Highness is talking about?

00:34:58.905 --> 00:34:59.745
Fire oil.

00:35:11.785 --> 00:35:13.825
FERRYMAN’S LODGE

00:35:13.905 --> 00:35:18.145
Your Highness, Chu Zhao
got our old ledgers by some means.

00:35:18.905 --> 00:35:20.105
At today's court, she proposed

00:35:20.185 --> 00:35:22.905
transport of fire oil
should need her approval.

00:35:23.625 --> 00:35:25.865
How on earth did she learn of this?

00:35:26.905 --> 00:35:28.425
Didn't I tell you?

00:35:28.505 --> 00:35:31.425
Nothing shall go wrong with the ledgers!

00:35:31.505 --> 00:35:35.025
Your Highness, Chu Zhao sent men
to watch us closely.

00:35:35.105 --> 00:35:36.105
We really can't guard against her.

00:35:37.665 --> 00:35:39.305
She made one move after another

00:35:40.225 --> 00:35:42.185
just to make me panic.

00:35:42.945 --> 00:35:45.865
We'll set this aside for now.

00:35:46.545 --> 00:35:47.505
You…

00:35:47.585 --> 00:35:49.425
Send men to monitor Mr. Deng's mansion.

00:35:50.065 --> 00:35:52.145
Anything suspicious will be reported!

00:35:53.425 --> 00:35:54.625
Deng Yi

00:35:55.665 --> 00:35:57.665
is our last card.

00:35:58.385 --> 00:36:00.225
Nothing shall go wrong with him!

00:36:01.025 --> 00:36:02.145
I'm on it.

00:36:07.385 --> 00:36:11.545
IMPERIAL GUARD OFFICE

00:36:11.625 --> 00:36:13.465
Her Highness titled Mu Xiaoman

00:36:13.545 --> 00:36:15.865
Commander of the Imperial Guard Office?

00:36:18.385 --> 00:36:20.745
At today's court, you mentioned fire oil.

00:36:20.825 --> 00:36:23.465
I guess Xiao Xun will soon
lose his composure.

00:36:25.185 --> 00:36:27.505
My goal is to make him panic.

00:36:28.145 --> 00:36:29.345
Look.

00:36:29.425 --> 00:36:33.425
Only six hours later,
he sent his men to Mr. Deng's mansion.

00:36:34.945 --> 00:36:36.305
He wants Deng Yi to help?

00:36:36.945 --> 00:36:39.945
Deng Yi is in deep trouble himself,
crushed by Xie Yanfang.

00:36:41.585 --> 00:36:43.665
So, Mr. Deng is looking for a solution.

00:36:44.265 --> 00:36:47.905
The 25 guests for his banquet
are powerful officers,

00:36:47.985 --> 00:36:50.905
like commandants, captains,
and adjutant generals.

00:36:51.945 --> 00:36:54.345
He's a civil officer, but has a sharp eye.

00:36:55.185 --> 00:36:56.185
He's scared.

00:36:56.825 --> 00:36:59.105
Xie Yanfang holds military power.

00:36:59.185 --> 00:37:01.585
I command frontier troops.

00:37:01.665 --> 00:37:03.745
He needs to find some biting fighters

00:37:04.425 --> 00:37:07.305
to prevent himself from being eliminated.

00:37:07.985 --> 00:37:09.625
These are their attendants,

00:37:09.705 --> 00:37:12.265
including personal servants,
guards, and carters.

00:37:12.345 --> 00:37:13.625
Seventy-two in total.

00:37:14.665 --> 00:37:17.905
Oh. The new Roving General Liang Qiang

00:37:17.985 --> 00:37:20.265
was also invited to that banquet.

00:37:20.345 --> 00:37:22.145
When he was at the frontier,

00:37:22.225 --> 00:37:24.025
he had an unusual promotion.

00:37:24.825 --> 00:37:27.185
At that time, I guessed
he had some backing.

00:37:27.785 --> 00:37:29.265
So, it's Mr. Deng.

00:37:30.665 --> 00:37:32.025
Wise choice.

00:37:32.585 --> 00:37:34.985
Why did Deng Yi choose Liang Qiang?

00:37:35.985 --> 00:37:38.465
Back then, he was merely
a soldier at Wangcheng.

00:37:38.545 --> 00:37:41.305
-He had no power.
-Just because he was a mere soldier,

00:37:41.385 --> 00:37:44.145
he was more eager
to get promoted by any means.

00:37:45.065 --> 00:37:47.785
Besides, he wasn't a mere soldier.

00:37:50.465 --> 00:37:52.705
His clan was involved
with the Third Prince.

00:37:52.785 --> 00:37:54.305
That was a big clan.

00:37:54.385 --> 00:37:56.585
But they were exiled
for taking the wrong side.

00:37:57.545 --> 00:38:00.945
He turned from a rich young man
into a frontier soldier.

00:38:01.545 --> 00:38:04.225
How would he not resent it or hate it?

00:38:04.825 --> 00:38:06.385
Resentment and hatred

00:38:07.025 --> 00:38:09.145
-lead to ambitions.
-Exactly.

00:38:10.465 --> 00:38:11.825
Once a man like him

00:38:11.905 --> 00:38:14.705
gets a glimmer of hope,
he'll seize the chance

00:38:15.425 --> 00:38:18.065
and even work with the devil.

00:38:18.145 --> 00:38:21.065
So there's so much in court politics.

00:38:21.745 --> 00:38:23.185
I must learn carefully from Your Highness.

00:38:27.705 --> 00:38:29.865
Your Highness, have some tea I made.

00:38:39.425 --> 00:38:41.305
-Any more intel?
-The relationships

00:38:41.385 --> 00:38:43.785
in Mr. Deng's family
and his guests' family.

00:38:43.865 --> 00:38:46.585
Time was too short. It's not detailed.

00:38:52.465 --> 00:38:55.585
Four horses and five carriages.

00:38:55.665 --> 00:38:58.105
Even the number of trees is recorded.

00:38:58.185 --> 00:38:59.505
It's not detailed?

00:39:00.505 --> 00:39:03.385
Xiaoman, so besides fighting,

00:39:03.465 --> 00:39:05.745
you're also great at other things.

00:39:05.825 --> 00:39:07.825
I should learn from you.

00:39:08.345 --> 00:39:09.905
It's nothing.

00:39:09.985 --> 00:39:12.865
When I was at Cangmu Stronghold,
I scouted before taking action.

00:39:13.465 --> 00:39:15.585
The size of the family,
the location of the door and window,

00:39:15.665 --> 00:39:17.785
warehouses, and carriages…
All information was needed.

00:39:19.265 --> 00:39:21.065
I thought you couldn't handle this.

00:39:21.145 --> 00:39:22.465
I underestimated you.

00:39:23.065 --> 00:39:25.105
Most of the conversations
at Mr. Deng's banquet

00:39:25.185 --> 00:39:26.665
have been recorded.

00:39:27.305 --> 00:39:31.785
But we failed to eavesdrop
on confidential conversations.

00:39:32.625 --> 00:39:36.345
You just started doing this.
No hurry. Take your time.

00:39:36.425 --> 00:39:40.345
Now, you command 700 guards
of the Imperial Guard Office.

00:39:40.425 --> 00:39:42.185
You supervise on my orders.

00:39:42.265 --> 00:39:45.105
You act discreetly
just to avoid disturbing people

00:39:45.185 --> 00:39:46.785
and causing unnecessary trouble.

00:39:46.865 --> 00:39:49.985
But even if you're caught,
you don't need to flee.

00:39:50.945 --> 00:39:52.865
-I got it.
-Besides,

00:39:53.425 --> 00:39:54.665
I set up the Imperial Guard Office,

00:39:54.745 --> 00:39:57.785
so that you can openly command
some of the Longwei Army.

00:39:57.865 --> 00:40:00.145
Actually, there is a bigger purpose.

00:40:01.065 --> 00:40:03.865
Monitor every move of the frontier troops

00:40:03.945 --> 00:40:05.345
and report it to me immediately.

00:40:06.985 --> 00:40:09.705
You're doing this
for Xie Yanlai, aren't you?

00:40:10.385 --> 00:40:12.865
To clear the obstacles
from his killing mission.

00:40:16.065 --> 00:40:18.705
Don't blab. Leave. Leave now.

00:40:31.185 --> 00:40:34.545
Jiu, I hope this will help you.